flowchart TD
S([Any protected route request]) --> T{Token present and signed JWT valid?}
T -- No --> E[401; deny before feature logic]
T -- Yes --> X{Expiry still valid against server clock?}
X -- No --> E
X -- Yes --> O[Derive account id from verified subject; reject or ignore client owner]
O --> Q{Object request or collection request?}
Q -- Collection --> C[Query or create only verified account data]
Q -- Object --> R{Requested object belongs to verified account?}
R -- No --> D[403 or 404; no mutation]
R -- Yes --> F[Run feature operation using owner-qualified object]
C --> Z([Return feature result])
F --> Z
